							<br><br>

							<<link [[다음|Farm Lorry Pregnant Variant]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>

						<<elseif (playerAwareTheyArePregnant() and playerIsPregnant() and talkedAboutPregnancy("pc","Alex"))>>

							너한테는 너무 위험해," <<he>>【이가】 좌절한 듯이 말한다.
							<br><br>

							<<He>>【이가】 맞아. 임신한 <<woman>>【이가】 싸움판에 끼어들면 안 된다.
							<br><br>

							<<link [[다음|Farm Lorry Pregnant Variant]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>

						<<else>>
